Package: DSMHelper
Title: Distance Sampling and Density Surface Modelling Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dave", "Fifield", email = "fifielddave@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Utility functions for preparing data, fitting detection functions,
    building density surface models (DSMs), generating predictions, and
    estimating variance for seabird at-sea density analyses based on ECSAS
    survey data. Extracted from the Atlantic DSM analysis pipeline.
